 ", with respect to the counting measure.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"9719b9b0-119f-4afd-a1ab-8ae2d1f0051b"],

Cell["\<\
Definition: the density of a shape is the number of times it covers each \
vertex: once for a vertex, once per occurrence in a vertex list, and once per \
walk through the vertex for a family of walks.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"cf6100d6-d2aa-4a8c-a022-36cf138df2f4"],

Cell["It reads every shape:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"723e0188-8d8d-4685-9680-403547225231"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "0ee8cf5b-846b-45e2-8ecf-cc0c76f6a96a"], Cell[TextData[StyleBox[
    "x", "TI"]], "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"f4226d41-c017-4b88-b096-a4647561bd4d"],
     Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
